      <title>A Call to Chapel with the Rev. Leslie D. Callahan, Ph.D. (in-person and virtual) at Cramton Auditorium</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/53687268726300/huge/a4a2b9547ba97a70d6c3322d959af11826879380.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Sun, 06 Sep 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>The Reverend Leslie D. Callahan, Ph.D.,  a native of Gary, West Virginia, experienced her first Christian education and formation at Apostolic Temple Church where she developed an enduring love for Jesus Christ and for Christ's body, the Church. Having experienced her call to ministry at an early age, Dr. Callahan began the public proclamation of the gospel at age 19.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>To learn more about our guest speaker, click here.</p>

