    <item>
      <title>9/11 Day of Remembrance at The Yard  (Upper Quad)</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/53879224047720/huge/2b41184eb1fe858948fe60e2a1045e61234afa28.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Wed, 09 Sep 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>9/11 Day of Remembrance: Three Days of Service</p>

<p>In commemoration of the 25th Anniversary of 9/11, Howard University and the Office of Student Affairs will host a three-day campaign dedicated to service, remembrance, and support for the local veteran community. Made possible through a grant from the 9/11 organization, the initiative will bring together students, veterans, faculty, staff, alumni, and community partners to address veteran homelessness, food insecurity, and community needs.</p>

<p>From September 9–11, participants will engage in hands-on service projects, including care-package preparation, donation drives, direct service with Access Housing, Inc., campus food pantry support, and meal preparation. The three-day experience will culminate on September 11 with a Day of Remembrance ceremony honoring those impacted by 9/11 and recognizing the enduring values of service and sacrifice.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Together, the Howard community will reflect, serve, and reaffirm its commitment to supporting veterans and strengthening the communities they serve.</p>

<p><a href="https://events.howard.edu/event/911-day-of-remembrance">View on site</a> | <a href="mailto:?subject=I found an interesting event%3A 9%2F11 Day of Remembrance&amp;body=I found an interesting event you may like%3A%0A%0A%0ADate%3A Sep 9%2C 2026%0A%0ADescription%3A%0A9%2F11 Day of Remembrance%3A Three Days of Service%0A%0A%0AIn commemoration of the 25th Anniversary of 9%2F11%2C Howard University and the Office of Student Affairs will host a three-day campaign dedicated to service%2C remembrance%2C and support for the local veteran community. Made possible through a grant from the 9%2F11 organization%2C the initiative will bring together students%2C veterans%2C faculty%2C staff%2C alumni%2C and community partners to address veteran homelessness%2C food insecurity%2C and community needs.%0A%0A%0AFrom September 9%E2%80%9311%2C participants will engage in hands-on service projects%2C including care-package preparation%2C donation drives%2C direct service with Access Housing%2C Inc.%2C campus food pantry support%2C and meal preparation. The three-day experience will culminate on September 11 with a Day of Remembrance ceremony honoring those impacted by 9%2F11 and recognizing the enduring values of service and sacrifice.%0A%0A %0A%0ATogether%2C the Howard community will reflect%2C serve%2C and reaffirm its commitment to supporting veterans and strengthening the communities they serve.%0A%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fevents.howard.edu%2Fevent%2F911-day-of-remembrance%0A">Email this event</a></p></div></div>]]></description>
